# ...except the browser demo's card, which is a shipped asset rather than a
# build artifact, exactly like tools_local/wasm/sdcard/xkcd/images.dat next to
# it. Without this a fresh worktree rebuilds the web card 1.3MB lighter and the
# Study app draws no Chinese at all -- silently, because nothing fails.
!tools_local/wasm/sdcard/study/fonts/KaiTi/*.cpfont
